    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="☯️"
    title="yin_yang"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/262f.svg"> Du &#228;r inte fast - R&#246;relse existerar &#228;ven i stillhet <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127793;"
    title="seedling"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f331.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
